      "independent_solution": "Line through O and P has slope 1/5 and equation y=x/5. The upper open connected component of its complement is y>x/5; its closure is y>=x/5. Seed has no definition settling whether 'upper halfplane' includes the line. Do not assert one as the uniquely intended original answer. A question may explicitly choose or contrast conventions, but cannot force an unspecified convention.",
