      "independent_solution": "a) x!=0, region y>=10/x for both signs, boundary hyperbola included, entire y-axis excluded. b) xy>=10: x>0 requires y>=10/x; x<0 requires y<=10/x (division reverses); x=0 impossible. c) x!=0, y<=4/x on both signs; y-axis excluded. d) xy<=4: x>0 gives y<=4/x, x<0 gives y>=4/x, and every point with x=0 satisfies 0<=4. Hyperbola boundaries included."
